  "body": "Both variants said they create an ordered set \"as long as m is greater than or\nequal to n\" (or greater than n), which left the decreasing case open to\ninterpretation. Turn them into steps so that the precondition can be a proper\nassert.\n\nAlso note that the exclusive range is usually what is needed for lists, and move\nthe example next to the inclusive range it illustrates.\n\n",
